_index":"148614","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320728005:0":{"text":"お母さん、誰と話してるの？僕、知らない奴は嫌いだよ！","source_cn":"妈妈，你在和谁说话？我不喜欢其他人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AF48C64FBE64E54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320728006:0":{"text":"大丈夫よ、<male>この人</male><female>この人</female>は悪い人じゃないと思うわ。","source_cn":"没关系的，这位<male>先生</male><fema...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xADCA1FDD05451B39","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"大丈夫よ、<male>この人</male><female>この人</female>は悪い人じゃないと思うわ。","female":"大丈夫よ、<male>この人</male><female>この人</female>は悪い人じゃないと思うわ。","variant_male_record_index":"148616","variant_female_record_index":"148617","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320728007:0":{"text":"ごめんなさい……目が見えなくなったせいで、この子、少しイライラしてるの……","source_cn":"真抱歉……自从巴维尔的眼睛看不见了，他的性格也变得暴躁敏感。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8BFD2B652CADC824","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ごめんなさい……目が見えなくなったせいで、この子、少しイライラしてるの……","female":"ごめんなさい……目が見えなくなったせいで、この子、少しイライラしてるの……","variant_male_record_index":"148618","variant_female_record_index":"148619","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320728008:1":{"text":"うるさいな！もう黙ってよ、ママ！","source_cn":"别说了妈妈！你可真啰嗦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C86A96DBD66156E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320728009:1":{"text":"ご機嫌斜めな声が聞こえましたけど、どうしたんです？","source_cn":"怎么了？我好像听见有人在发脾气？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x873A29766A590A9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320728010:0":{"text":"シロクマ温泉旅館へようこそ！ボクはクインと申します。ここでは、嫌なことなんて全部忘れて、楽しいひとときをお過ごしいただけますよ！","source_cn":"这两位客人，欢迎来到白熊温泉旅店！我是洛桑，我保证你们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA68E1C2D1646325","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320728011:0":{"text":"ちょっと待った。その前に伝えておきたいことがあるべさ。","source_cn":"等等，让我先说两句。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA566A235A5A6560F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320728012:1":{"text":"お客さん、うちの旅館の温泉に魔法なんてないし、難病を治す効果なんてないことは、今のうちにはっきり言っておくよ。","source_cn":"这位客人，我不是那种会撒谎的老板，我家的温泉并没有魔法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4F5073041FE6CED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320728013:1":{"text":"けれど、温泉に入ればリラックスできる。それがお子さんの回復の助けになるかもしれないし、何の効果もないかもしれない……その辺は理解しといておくれ。","source_cn":"但是泡温泉能让你们的精神得到放松，这可能有利于您儿子康...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D4E4CDC1ACAA4BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320728014:1":{"text":"それは……","source_cn":"这……<key:dialog32>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6551C0BACCE0A87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320728015:0":{"text":"ああもう！だから目なんて治りっこないって言ったのに、ママが来たがるから！","source_cn":"烦死了！我早说了我的眼睛根本治不好，你非要来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9F2075CE9B31239","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320728016:0":{"text":"そんな……ママはただ、あなたのためを思って……","source_cn":"你怎么能怪我呢？我还不是为了你好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0934DBFADF4B9EF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320728017:0":{"text":"まあまあ、お二人さん！そろそろ吹雪いてきそうですし、今日はここで一晩泊まっていってくださいよ。","source_cn":"二位客人！别着急，外面又要下大雪了，先在这里住一晚吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAE64BF957ACE567","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1320728018:1":{"text":"見たところ、お二人には休息が必要です。暖かい布団でぐっすり寝れば、きっと気分も晴れますよ！","source_cn":"您二位非常需要休息，只要在暖和的被窝里睡个好觉，阴霾一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D88FC173D3F067D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320728019:1":{"text":"そうね……せっかく来たんだし。","source_cn":"好吧……来都来了。","status":"matched","h